# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform, not just in the repository.
#
# With git's default autocrlf on Windows, checked-out source gets CRLF while
# cljfmt normalizes to LF — so `npm run fmt:check` would report every file as
# misformatted immediately after a fresh clone. Forcing eol=lf keeps Windows,
# macOS and the Linux CI runner byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets, once we have them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3  binary
*.m4a  binary
*.wav  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
